WEBVTT

00:09:27.396 --> 00:09:31.442
The Philadelphia Quicksteppers
become the Philadelphia Tribunes.

00:09:31.859 --> 00:09:36.280
And I bring this up
because the very next year, 1932,

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:37.990
there's an intracity rival --

00:09:38.032 --> 00:09:42.119
the Germantown Hornets
with Ora Washington, very famous player.

00:09:43.037 --> 00:09:46.874
And they decide, the two of them --
Germantown, the Tribunes --

00:09:46.874 --> 00:09:50.794
to play a five-game series to determine
the best team in Philadelphia.

00:09:51.503 --> 00:09:54.757
Remember, storylines
was part of the deal.

00:09:54.757 --> 00:09:57.301
Five-game series goes to a fifth game.

00:09:57.885 --> 00:10:03.724
And this is how the "Tribune" writes
about the atmosphere in game five, 1932: